{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16234480","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16234480","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1623448001:1":{"text":"我认为互助团队是个很好的切入点。通过报道他们，既能展现魔力受损者的现状，又能引发讨论。","source_cn":"我认为互助团队是个很好的切入点。通过报道他们，既能展现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03AE09A3D952F6FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1623448002:1":{"text":"可你要怎么写这篇报道呢？奥莱雅几乎没透露什么。","source_cn":"可你要怎么写这篇报道呢？奥莱雅几乎没透露什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6977644ACD0CC3F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1623448003:1":{"text":"那些学生的状态比被契约控制时更差，甚至开始厌学，你这样写只会让事情更糟。","source_cn":"那些学生的状态比被契约控制时更差，甚至开始厌学，你这样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2103A3E9C6643AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1623448004:1":{"text":"你放心，我没打算丑化受害的学生。","source_cn":"你放心，我没打算丑化受害的学生。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B04C6A8578026CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1623448005:1":{"text":"比起学生……你不觉得学校领导层应该负最大的责任吗？这是他们的失职！","source_cn":"比起学生……你不觉得学校领导层应该负最大的责任吗？这是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F02C49650D463F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_